<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>STRIKES - A SCHOOL OF WAR, BUT NOT THE WAR ITSELF</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Impact&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            background: #111;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            font-family: "Impact", sans-serif;
        }

        .poster {
            width: 340px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 8px solid #222;
            position: relative;
        }

        .header {
            background: #c8102e;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 12px 18px 8px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 42px;
            line-height: 1;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .header-sub {
            font-size: 17px;
            padding-top: 6px;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 22px 18px 18px;
            background: #f9f9f9;
        }

        .strike-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.55;
            color: #333;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        .strike-text strong {
            color: #000;
        }

        .crowd {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .crowd img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .flag-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 14px 0 18px;
        }

        .flag {
            display: inline-block;
            width: 220px;
            height: 210px;
            background: linear-gradient(#c8102e, #d6283a);
            border: 6px solid #111;
            border-radius: 6px;
            position: relative;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .flag img {
            position: absolute;
            top: 12px;
            left: 14px;
            width: 192px;
            height: 186px;
            object-fit: cover;
            object-position: center;
        }

        .flag-text {
            position: absolute;
            top: 32px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px #000;
            pointer-events: none;
            z-index: 10;
            line-height: 1;
        }

        .flag-text .top {
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
        }

        .flag-text .bottom {
            font-size: 10px;
            margin-top: -2px;
        }

        .police {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 14px 0 22px;
        }

        .police img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #222;
            color: #fff;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            font-size: 12.5px;
            line-height: 1.4;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .footer p {
            margin: 0;
        }

        .footer small {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-size: 11px;
            color: #aaa;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="poster">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="header">
            STRIKES<br>
            <div class="header-sub">A SCHOOL OF WAR,<br>BUT NOT THE WAR ITSELF.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <!-- Lenin quote block -->
            <p class="strike-text">
                A strike teaches workers to understand what the strength of the employers and what the strength of the workers consists in; it teaches them not to think of their own immediate workmates alone but of all the employers, the whole class of capitalists and the whole class of workers.
            </p>

            <!-- Crowd photo -->
            <div class="crowd">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/340x210/2c2c2c/ffffff?text=Crowd+at+strike+rally" alt="Crowd of workers at strike rally">
            </div>

            <!-- Red flag -->
            <div class="flag-container">
                <div class="flag">
                    <!-- Flag image placeholder -->
                    <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/192x186/ffffff/1a1a1a?text=REDDENED+BY+THE+MINERS" alt="Miners banner">
                    <div class="flag-text">
                        <span class="top">MINERS</span>
                        <span class="bottom">AREA</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Police photo -->
            <div class="police">
                <img src="https://via.placeholder.com/340x170/1a1a1a/ffffff?text=Police+confronting+striking+workers" alt="Police line confronting crowd">
            </div>

            <!-- Lenin quote bottom -->
            <p class="strike-text">
                A strike, moreover, opens the eyes of the workers to the nature, not only of the capitalists, but of the government and the laws as well.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="footer">
            <p>— LENIN</p>
            <small>Vladimir Lenin, 1906</small>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
```
